    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a bad clicker game. possibly the worst clicker game. enjoy~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sweatshop to click\u00a0 to your hearts content!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong>\u00a0FAKE</strong> cash shop with all the solutions to any ills~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated production to give the hand a break!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline production, so you can win the game without touching it (kinda)~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tech trees to unlock new features, functions, and bonuses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute lil pets to grow alongside you~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the solar system and make friends with everyone along the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosaving so you don't have to worry about it~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mute button and Volume Sliders~!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a button. you know you want to poke it... (note, buttons may be fragile and/or defective) <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519130/extras/4a4a4f3aedec8ce047d6b75a7e04be0a.avif?t=1741130568\" width=704 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the shop~ (note, not real money, just a simulacrum of industry practices)\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519130/extras/c3ac5ff2d5b437d0cff882b0b99824ce.avif?t=1741130568\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >spend your hard earned scrip at the prestige tree~ (note, not a real tree)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519130/extras/5f951125995b5e1a69e4b65efd5d9a60.avif?t=1741130568\" width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lil friendos~ (like Snailey here)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519130/extras/Snailey.png?t=1741130568\" width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >friendmaking~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519130/extras/5245ed7fa822636f76b77939d38c4857.avif?t=1741130568\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>an unnecessarily long adventure full of unnecessarily obscure allusions~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519130/extras/Joro.png?t=1741130568\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(aint nobody gonna clear all that lol)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519130/extras/88d39f89581a18fcf748ac444a3eddbb.avif?t=1741130568\" width=754 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more (maybe)~</p>",
